  "task": "I'm the regional health coordinator for Pinecrest District reporting a Legionnaires' disease cluster linked to the Summit Hotel's cooling tower system. Please verify the outbreak scope through case analysis and environmental reports, then implement containment by closing affected facilities and allocating decontamination resources, and finally notify the public while issuing an epidemiological report with prevention guidelines."
